## Practice Scripts

- `01-namespaces.yaml`: Provisions namespaces `cka-portal` and `cka-secure-db`.
- `02-workloads.yaml`: Deploys frontend, unauthorized client, and database pods.
- `03-cross-namespace-policy.yaml`: Applies cross-namespace ingress and egress rules.
- `test-advanced-netpol.sh`: Automated matrix testing verifying authorized connections pass and unauthorized connections drop.
